  "summary": "Decision 18 counted run-04's attachment from a truncated RCA row; it now carries the RCA's own count.",
  "why": "The decision opened with 27 attachments, summing the RCA's observation-to-subject row of 13 CONCERNS_FEATURE, 3 LIES_BENEATH and 11 LOCATED_WITHIN. That cell ends in an ellipsis, so 27 is a floor read as a total. The RCA's own count of what decision 18 is about is 55 science relations, neither bibliographic nor contribution, 34 of them LOCAL, against run-08's none. The decision and the pack test now say that, and the phrase is guarded. No mechanism, slot, refusal or census changes."
}
